---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Cement & Building Material Certification | EUROCERT Asia"
  description="EN 197-1 cement certification, factory production control (FPC) and construction products testing by EUROCERT Asia."
  canonicalUrl="https://www.eurocert.asia/cement/"
  ogImage="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367859/eurocert/Untitled_design_19_.png.png"
  keywords="Eurocert,Cement certification,EN 197-1,construction products,FPC audit,building materials testing"
>
<style is:global>@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:900;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-solid-900.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Brands";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-brands-400.woff2) format('woff2')}@font-face{font-family:"Font Awesome 6 Free";font-style:normal;font-weight:400;font-display:swap;src:url(https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/webfonts/fa-regular-400.woff2) format('woff2')}</style>
<section class="relative min-h-[55vh] flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-[#030a16]"><div class="absolute inset-0 z-0"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367994/eurocert/c5.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover opacity-30" alt="Cement"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#030a16]/70 via-[#030a16]/40 to-[#030a16]"></div></div><div class="container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10 text-center py-20"><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-eurogold-400/30 bg-eurogold-400/5 mb-6"><span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-eurogold-400 animate-pulse"></span><span class="heading-font text-[10px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.3em] uppercase font-bold">Construction Products Regulation</span></div><h1 class="heading-font text-4xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold text-white mb-3 tracking-tight" style="text-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(212,168,67,0.3)">CE Marking for Cement</h1><p class="text-white/90 text-sm md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">CE marking is a declaration of conformity that enables manufacturers to demonstrate that their cement products meet the essential requirements of the applicable EU regulations.</p><div class="mt-8"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#030a16] bg-eurogold-400 rounded-full px-8 py-3.5 hover:bg-eurogold-300 transition-all shadow-lg shadow-eurogold-400/20" href="/#contact">Click For Free Consultation <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[9px]"></i></a></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 items-start"><div class="lg:col-span-3 space-y-6"><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Why It Matters</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Importance of CE Marking <span class="text-euro-600">for Cement</span></h2></div><p class="text-slate-500 text-[15px] leading-relaxed">CE marking is a declaration of conformity that enables manufacturers to demonstrate that their product meets the essential requirements of the applicable EU regulations. It is important for cement manufacturers because it:</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-hard-hat text-white text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Ensures that the cement is safe to use for construction purposes</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-balance-scale text-white text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Helps to establish uniform safety standards across the EU</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-exchange-alt text-white text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Facilitates free movement of goods within the EU by removing trade barriers</p></div><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-4 rounded-xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-trophy text-white text-xs"></i></div><p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Enhances the credibility and competitiveness of the manufacturer</p></div></div></div><div class="lg:col-span-2 relative rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-xl border border-slate-100 h-[320px] md:h-[420px] group"><img src="https://res.cloudinary.com/dwnnakrrh/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto:good,w_1600/v1782367994/eurocert/c5.png.png" class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" alt="Cement CE Marking"/><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-slate-900/20 via-transparent to-transparent"></div></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_left,rgba(212,168,67,0.05)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-bullseye text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Scope of CE Marking for Cement</h4></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-3">CE marking for cement is required under the Construction Products Regulation (CPR) of the EU. It applies to all construction products intended to be used for construction purposes in the EU.</p><p class="text-white/45 text-xs leading-relaxed">Any cement intended for sale within the EEA must carry the CE marking.</p></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3"><div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-book text-eurogold-400 text-xs"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Annex I — Essential Requirements</h4></div><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Annex I of the CPR outlines the essential requirements for CE marking of cement. These requirements are designed to ensure that cement is safe to use and complies with EU regulations.</p></div></div><div class="text-center mb-8"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Annex I — CPR</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight">Essential Requirements for CE Marking of Cement</h2></div><div class="space-y-4"><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center">01</span><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/5 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-building text-eurogold-400/60 text-xs"></i></div></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Mechanical Resistance &amp; Stability</h4><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Cement must have sufficient mechanical resistance and stability to withstand the weight and stresses of the structures it is used to build. Cement manufacturers must ensure that their products meet the relevant European harmonized standards for mechanical resistance and stability.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center">02</span><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/5 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-fire-extinguisher text-eurogold-400/60 text-xs"></i></div></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Safety in Case of Fire</h4><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Cement must meet safety requirements in case of fire, including its ability to resist fire and prevent the spread of flames. To comply with relevant European harmonized standards for fire safety, cement manufacturers must ensure that their products are tested.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-2 shrink-0"><span class="heading-font text-eurogold-400 font-bold text-sm w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center">03</span><div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/5 flex items-center justify-center"><i class="fas fa-leaf text-eurogold-400/60 text-xs"></i></div></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">Hygiene, Health &amp; the Environment</h4><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Cement must be safe for human health and the environment. This includes its composition, production process, and the impact of its use on the environment. Manufacturers must ensure their products are tested to comply with relevant European harmonized standards.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-white"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Step by Step</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">CE Marking Process for Cement</h2></div><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-10"><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white text-center"><div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">01</span></div><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mt-3 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-search text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Identify Standards</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Identify the relevant harmonized standards for your cement product.</p></div><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white text-center"><div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">02</span></div><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mt-3 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-flask text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Testing &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Carry out necessary testing and assessment to ensure compliance with standards.</p></div><div class="relative p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-gradient-to-br from-euro-50/60 to-white text-center"><div class="absolute -top-3 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-euro-600 flex items-center justify-center"><span class="heading-font text-white text-xs font-bold">03</span></div><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mx-auto mt-3 mb-3"><i class="fas fa-certificate text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Affix CE Marking</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-xs leading-relaxed">Affix CE marking along with manufacturer info and product identification number.</p></div></div><div class="p-6 rounded-2xl border border-euro-100 bg-euro-50/30"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-eurogold-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-handshake text-white text-sm"></i></div><div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-2">On Behalf of Eurocert S.A</h4><p class="text-slate-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">We are offering above services on behalf of Eurocert S.A. Manufacturers must affix the CE marking to cement intended for sale within the EEA, which ensures the cement&#x27;s safety and compliance with the relevant harmonized standards.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-14 lg:py-18 bg-[#f8fafc]"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="text-center mb-10"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-euro-600 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Our Services</h4><h2 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 tracking-tight">Cement Certification Services</h2></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-5xl mx-auto"><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Certification &amp; Compliance</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Full scope verification for cement products against harmonized European standards (EN 197-1).</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-clipboard-check text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Audit &amp; Assessment</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Comprehensive testing and evaluation of cement composition, strength, and performance.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-chalkboard-teacher text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Training &amp; Consultancy</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Expert guidance on cement quality standards and factory production control requirements.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-headset text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Ongoing Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Continuous surveillance and annual audits to maintain cement product certification.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-file-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Documentation &amp; Reporting</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Declaration of Performance (DoP) preparation and technical documentation for cement.</p></div><div class="p-6 bg-white rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 hover:border-euro-200 hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300 group"><div class="w-11 h-11 rounded-xl bg-euro-50 flex items-center justify-center text-euro-600 mb-4 group-hover:bg-euro-600 group-hover:text-white transition-all duration-300"><i class="fas fa-sync-alt text-base"></i></div><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-900 mb-2">Remediation Support</h4><p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed">Corrective actions for non-conformities in cement production and quality control.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="relative overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#030a16]"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,rgba(212,168,67,0.06)_0%,transparent_60%)]"></div><div class="relative z-10 py-14 lg:py-18"><div class="container mx-auto px-6"><div class="grid lg:grid-cols-5 gap-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto"><div class="lg:col-span-3"><h4 class="heading-font text-[11px] text-eurogold-400 tracking-[0.5em] uppercase mb-2 font-bold">Why Choose Us</h4><h3 class="heading-font text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">Why Eurocert?</h3><p class="text-white/55 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">Manufacturers must follow the CE marking process to ensure their cement product meets EU requirements and can be sold across the EEA. Our experienced auditors understand cement certification requirements and guide you through the entire process.</p><div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div class="flex items-start gap-3 p-3 rounded-xl border border-white/5 bg-white/2"><div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-lg bg-eurogold-400/10 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"><i class="fas fa-check-circle text-eurogold-400 text-[10px]"></i></div><div><h5 class="text-white font-bold text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wide heading-font mb-0.5">Regulatory Compliance</h